[statement]
Two packages providing one name at a version are never installed together:
asked for `p1` and `p2`, which provide `v` at 1 and 2, apk refuses.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1
p:v=1

P:p2
V:1
p:v=2


[request]
p1
p2

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   p1-1:
|     conflicts: p2-1[v=1]
|     satisfies: world[p1]
|   p2-1:
|     conflicts: p1-1[v=2]
|     satisfies: world[p2]
refused
